# Environment for the cexd container in deploy/docker-compose.yml (week 7).
#
# LOCAL DEMO CREDENTIALS. They are published in this repository, so anyone
# can use them: never put them on a server reachable from another machine.
# They are exactly what `go run ./cmd/loadgen tokens loadtest/workloads/step.json`
# prints (a test keeps them in sync), so the load generator and the web UI
# both work against `make up` with no setup:
#   admin (can fund):  loadgen-local-admin-0001     user 1
#   traders:           loadgen-local-user-000000 … loadgen-local-user-000049
#                      users 1001 … 1050
